Sval: no app menu notice while the app menu button is not drawn

Sval's header has no app menu button, and `SvalAppNotices` gives the app
menu's notices to Sval's own buttons instead. A doorhanger
anchored to a button that is not drawn opens at no useful place, and a
badge on it is never seen. `PanelUI.init` keeps its suppression callback
private and `AppMenuNotifications` has no other consumer hook, so the
check goes where Firefox already stands its notices down for fullscreen.

